{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yvJjvK1uvO1794227860.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太經合組織APEC領導人非正式會議，下周三在深圳舉行，會議期間寄往深圳市的快遞包裹，都要過安檢。</p><p></p><p>為保障會議安全順利舉行，廣東省及深圳當局規定，從本月到22日前，對所有寄至深圳的快遞，實施臨時性安全管理措施，包括對快遞過機安檢或採取其他必要的查驗程序。如發現快遞不符合安全管理規定，會限制快遞投送。由於臨時措施可能影響快遞取貨時間，當局呼籲消費者合理安排網購。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:23:55.589861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:15:15.688859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:11.144992+00:00","content_hash":"a953622628cee5cb1f6848bb7da6c058dad5247e6cd7de76719591924b94f39e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:23:55.589861+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}